# SPA build output. Not extracted from etzhayyim/root (see README.md "現在地");
# docs/operator-quickstart.md has the operator create a placeholder here to
# smoke-test the edge proxy. It must never be committed.
appview/*/svelte/

# wrangler's local state/cache, created by `wrangler dev` and `--dry-run`.
.wrangler/
appview/*/.wrangler/
